// AWS S3 Public Access Block Removed  [tier: alert]  ATT&CK: T1562, T1578.005
// Detects removal or weakening of S3 Block Public Access (DeleteAccountPublicAccessBlock, DeletePublicAccessBlock,…
// False positives: Deliberate, reviewed changes to public-access settings (rare).
// Source: rules/defense-evasion/s3-disable-public-access-block.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^DeleteAccountPublicAccessBlock$/i or eventName=/^DeletePublicAccessBlock$/i or eventName=/^PutAccountPublicAccessBlock$/i or eventName=/^PutPublicAccessBlock$/i eventSource=/^s3\.amazonaws\.com$/i
